{"id":"b65c91a555017a90","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Borel Cantelli Family","display":"df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family — ZFC Prob4 Borel Cantelli Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family — ZFC Prob4 Borel Cantelli Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family — ZFC Prob4 Borel Cantelli Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f804bc8a063d6592\" href=\"?note=f804bc8a063d6592\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（事件序列谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S\\)</span> (independent-event-family predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f804bc8a063d6592\" href=\"?note=f804bc8a063d6592\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))&lt;\\infty\n\\lor\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\vec A)\n\\land\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))=\\infty\n\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left[\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))&lt;\\infty\n\\lor\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\vec A)\n\\land\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))=\\infty\n\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The event family is an explicitly guarded function, and every series term is the bound value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A(n)\">\\(\\vec A(n)\\)</span> rather than an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\">\\(A_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The predicate records the two standard hypothesis regimes instead of embedding their theorem conclusions into a definition.</li>\n<li>In the summable regime, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=0\">\\(\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=0\\)</span>. In the independent divergent regime, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=1\">\\(\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"f804bc8a063d6592","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}$ (probability-space predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"f804bc8a063d6592","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S$ (independent-event-family predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}cantelli\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4BorelCantelliFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\left[\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))<\\infty\n\\lor\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega,\\vec A)\n\\land\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))=\\infty\n\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec A(n)","display":false},{"tex":"A_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P(\\limsup_n\\vec A(n))=1","display":false}],"bytes":1994,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family.md|58-df-zfc-prob4-borel-cantelli-family]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f804bc8a063d6592","0578a357a86e9d8f","5045d216c83e75cb","36d7463d215be751"]}